    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breadbulls</strong> is an idle economy simulation game where you can get a job, invest in various companies, lobby politicians, take out loans, buy bonds, and beg your family for money. Play in <strong>Arcade</strong>, where time moves very quickly, each run lasting a few days, or\u00a0<strong>Realism</strong>, where time moves in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set high scores for yourself by getting more and more rich the more you learn and the bolder and more strategic your decisions are, or lose everything and go bankrupt!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breadbulls</strong> is an idle economy simulation game where you can get a job, invest in various companies, lobby politicians, take out loans, buy bonds, and beg your family for money. Play in <strong>Arcade</strong>, where time moves very quickly, each run lasting a few days, or\u00a0<strong>Realism</strong>, where time moves in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set high scores for yourself by getting more and more rich the more you learn and the bolder and more strategic your decisions are, or lose everything and go bankrupt!</p>",
    "short_description": "Ever wanted to be a milli-billi-trillionaire? Well that's not happening. At least in real life, but in Breadbulls you can simulate your dream career and the stock moves you aren't brave enough to do in real life and much more.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
